{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/96a2981bff1c8c0600ab9d37e48a937e.avif?t=1772825216\" width=768 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceborn: Awakening is a <i>narrative-driven roguelite bullet-heaven\u00a0</i>where you step into the role of a legendary space crew, answering a mysterious distress signal from a ghostly outer-system space station. Eliminate hordes of the Voss Praetor\u2019s corrupted army, awaken your true potential, learn the truth about the first Spaceborn and reckon with a stellar force that will decide the fate of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/6d85c8ca9740d1ec380f47daebf4dbc5.avif?t=1772825216\" width=512 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.poster.avif?t=1772825216\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.webm?t=1772825216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.mp4?t=1772825216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of enemies, uncover forbidden experiments, and face the void corruption. Unlock powerful weapons, harness your emerging Spaceborn abilities, and survive for as long as you can. How deep will you venture before the void consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/7da748f8d8e4d861ee119d2a8079012c.avif?t=1772825216\" width=512 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.poster.avif?t=1772825216\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.webm?t=1772825216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.mp4?t=1772825216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all of the Story Chapters to Awaken your true potential. Completing the Story Mode Campaign unlocks each class\u2019s full \u201cawakening\u201d potential, opening up advanced abilities and expanded playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable power boosts mean that no two awakenings will ever go exactly the same, while persistent unlocks and story fragments will help players piece together the true power of becoming a Spaceborn - and the forces they\u2019ve awakened along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/81aa5cbcf126833491d6d90bdab42d06.avif?t=1772825216\" width=525 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/3bbad5d4d064772686fcf33aa54b9337.poster.avif?t=1772825216\" width=1170 height=658 ><source sr